Now I have returned to my apartment.
It has become night.
The room is very comfortable.
I sit near the table with my travel diary.
I write today's memories in my own diary.
Today was a very beautiful day.
In the morning, I went by train.
At twelve o'clock in the day, I boarded a boat.
I saw many beautiful places.
I also look at the photos taken on my own camera.
Today my younger sister Sofia sent me her photos.
She was with her friends.
But, this was my first solo trip outside Kochi.
The journey happened very well.
I close the diary.
Tomorrow is Monday, I need to go to the office.
Therefore, I am going to sleep.
